\n<img alt=\"消委會罐頭魚安全推介｜罐頭吞拿魚： 美味牌 礦泉水浸吞拿魚 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec017a6803ec42ca80e63ffd757d9ff6/2023-06/126_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會罐頭魚安全推介｜罐頭吞拿魚：美味牌 葵花籽油浸 吞拿魚  \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/669691d86ccb270191bda238b02b042d/2023-06/127_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會罐頭魚安全推介｜罐頭吞拿魚： Greenseas Tuna Chunks in Springwater\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75445e60aa637e5c0beb469870e7ae46/2023-06/128_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會罐頭魚安全推介｜罐頭吞拿魚：Olasagasti Yellowfin Tuna in Olive Oil \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73ffd82069f84c2e289d76733ccda426/2023-06/129_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"消委會罐頭魚安全推介｜罐頭吞拿魚：風味牌 綠咖哩吞拿魚 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ffbeacad8959a4e71797f7c28c5185d1/2023-06/130_2.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T05:19:47.904883+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":622,"images":25,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}